OL,3,GNEWSASkinny dip event now a
OL,4,A'celebration of life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular skinny dip has grown into its
OL,7,Fown community and a "celebration of
OL,8,Flife", its organiser says.
OL,10,FJax Higginson, 48, from Sunderland,
OL,11,Forganises the North East Skinny Dip,
OL,12,Fwhich was held at Druridge Bay in
OL,13,FNorthumberland on Sunday morning.
OL,15,FThe event, which started 14 years ago,
OL,16,Fraises money for the mental health
OL,17,Fcharity Mind in Tyneside and
OL,18,FNorthumberland.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
